Package: athenasip
Architecture: any
Depends: adduser, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: multi-master, clusterable SIP proxy and registrar
 AthenaSIP is a SIP server: RFC 3261 transactions, registrar and proxying,
 SIP over WebSocket with WebRTC media through rtpengine, presence and busy
 lamp fields, trunks to carriers and routing scripted in Lua.
 .
 A single node needs nothing but itself. Nodes that share a Redis and an
 MQTT broker form a cluster in which any node serves any subscriber. The
 datastore, event bus, media engine, push services and routing policy are
 plugins behind one contract.
